<title>HONG KONG: China Construction mandate US$30 mln FRN.</title>
<headline>China Construction mandate US$30 mln FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>China Construction Holdings Ltd has mandated BA Asia and KorAm Bank to arrange a US$30 million floating rate note issue, bankers said on Friday.</p>
<p>They said the facility has a tenor of three years.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
